  OpenMausBot PR #663 (mascot body catalog, desktop data and picker only)
    merge commit d789f849a1bc42c0e6bba2be9a339eee72ad8f9a; catalog data as of
    commit 2da55d778e747d843084f7911d96e8f47cf2b3ca
    Nine generated mascot body outlines (blob, circle, squircle, capsule,
    drop, shield, hexagon, diamond, star) with their fit transforms and face
    anchors, copied verbatim; a per-bot body field; and a body picker.
    Upstream's cursor outline, generator scripts and phone renderers were not
    taken; Murage's Ember flame stays the default body.
    Seven of the nine outlines (blob, circle, capsule, drop, shield, hexagon,
    star) have since been superseded by Blob Studio artwork; see the Blob
    Studio entry below. Two remain as copied: squircle and diamond.
    Murage: shared/mascot-bodies.ts, src/components/Avatar.tsx,
    src/components/BotProfileAvatarCard.tsx, server/bot-profile.ts and the
